# <%= className %> integration tests

API-to-API integration tests with [Vitest](https://vitest.dev) and the native
`fetch` client. No mocks — these run against real, running services.

## Layout

- `src/config.ts` — base URLs of every service under test, read from env
- `src/api-client.ts` — thin `fetch` wrapper (`createApiClient(baseUrl)`)
- `tests/setup.ts` — pre-flight reachability check on every configured service
- `tests/<%= fileName %>.spec.ts` — the tests

## Running

```bash
cp .env.example .env   # or export the vars
nx test <%= fileName %>
```

Set `API_BASE_URL` (and any downstream URLs added to `config.services`) to point
at the environment you want to test. Tests are **not** cached by Nx and files run
serially (`fileParallelism: false`) since they share live state.
